          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "**What each later change had to hold in mind.** Adding a run state meant remembering to call `track()` or the drawing vanished; changing the finished counts meant knowing `cells` was rebuilt and trimmed; moving a button meant following both trees. After the fix each of these is a field on `StripState` or a line in one renderer."
